&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 6px; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
